{"w":2400,"h":3106,"lines":[{"c":1,"t":"Introduction","y":0.064778299978805687,"x":0.7818086396939985,"w":0.11119475046793614,"h":0.017245725593640571},{"w":0.32169654846191409,"h":0.018352706280356457,"c":1,"t":"ACADEMIC TEST FORMAT","x":0.10701335662065484,"y":0.1088165562381006},{"x":0.10675339211012791,"t":"Listening","y":0.14561780282488612,"w":0.09862052281697592,"c":1,"h":0.017079351490263961},{"w":0.71080271402994788,"h":0.02060457513321623,"t":"This test consists of four sections, each with ten questions. The first two sections are","c":1,"x":0.1070040272806987,"y":0.17145028799498974},{"x":0.10512015336733953,"t":"concerned with social needs. The first section is a conversation between two speakers and","h":0.022889089983505917,"c":1,"y":0.18871560308537827,"w":0.76717590332031249},{"y":0.20726270042687611,"w":0.7408850606282551,"h":0.021142292698198784,"c":1,"t":"the second section is a monologue. The final two sections are concerned with situations","x":0.10510765948732664},{"w":0.77289555867513016,"c":1,"h":0.022881436025566693,"y":0.22444662937510329,"x":0.10509733101914719,"t":"related to educational or training contexts. The third section is a conversation between up to"},{"t":"four people and the fourth section is a monologue.","w":0.42708989461263031,"h":0.019578463326556772,"x":0.10318475119792608,"y":0.24381699364413345,"c":1},{"w":0.69388437906901046,"c":1,"h":0.021428294283147853,"t":"A variety of question types is used, including: multiple choice, matching, plan\/map\/","x":0.12578204695918552,"y":0.26254155599795337},{"x":0.10503594178707147,"h":0.025988439399046159,"t":"diagram labelling, form completion, note completion, table completion, flow-chart completion,","w":0.7805691019694011,"y":0.27787718673520967,"c":1},{"y":0.29832717140268517,"x":0.10323872801012901,"h":0.020591685484857347,"c":1,"t":"summary completion, sentence completion and short-answer questions.","w":0.60745503743489582},{"t":"Candidates hear the recording once only and answer the questions as they listen. Ten","y":0.31562526696335791,"x":0.1238774939269634,"w":0.72403635660807297,"h":0.022383083778278134,"c":1},{"x":0.1032487925379085,"c":1,"y":0.33364875747963096,"h":0.021365596184174773,"w":0.77098739624023438,"t":"minutes are allowed at the end for candidates to transfer their answers to the answer sheet."},{"t":"Reading","x":0.1046252055311532,"y":0.3651166439105249,"h":0.016792713713047247,"c":1,"w":0.086017602284749362},{"h":0.024787566313341447,"c":1,"t":"This test consists of three sections with 40 questions. There are three texts, which are","y":0.3880819409669154,"x":0.10313088701936636,"w":0.72228251139322919},{"w":0.76721099853515629,"h":0.021712523618208079,"t":"taken from journals, books, magazines and newspapers. The texts are on topics of general","y":0.4080096294757305,"c":1,"x":0.10133745165531839},{"y":0.42585613018351776,"c":1,"w":0.50980753580729166,"h":0.020968801347348132,"x":0.10130552062413746,"t":"interest. At least one text contains detailed logical argument."},{"y":0.44444730865205551,"x":0.12200957124343338,"w":0.70708196004231771,"h":0.021974343756131054,"c":1,"t":"A variety of question types is used, including: multiple choice, identifying information"},{"t":"(True\/False\/Not Given), identifying the writer's views\/claims (Yes\/No\/Not Given), matching","h":0.022980190751173413,"c":1,"x":0.10132543190708987,"y":0.46178298530178108,"w":0.75597284952799482},{"w":0.75791213989257811,"y":0.48088383740251683,"x":0.099410298356853749,"c":1,"t":"information, matching headings, matching features, matching sentence endings, sentence","h":0.024676679720513239},{"t":"completion, summary completion, note completion, table completion, flow-chart completion,","x":0.10135101625589707,"y":0.49905038779009814,"w":0.77100743611653655,"h":0.022837808956581052,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.10127473628181415,"y":0.51728257094802688,"w":0.45908538818359379,"t":"diagram label completion and short-answer questions.","h":0.020436804600093561},{"t":"Writing","h":0.023017539413068944,"y":0.54458158404449097,"c":1,"x":0.10016033467335156,"w":0.077844003041585286},{"w":0.75592524210611989,"y":0.57364355933408007,"t":"This test consists of two tasks. It is suggested that candidates spend about 20 minutes on","x":0.099466879341558651,"h":0.020896594753130326,"c":1},{"w":0.74835306803385415,"c":1,"y":0.59257343348837155,"x":0.099502704994968286,"h":0.021084052857781588,"t":"Task 1, which requires them to write at least 150 words, and 40 minutes on Task 2, which"},{"x":0.097744352863058825,"t":"requires them to write at least 250 words. Task 2 contributes twice as much as Task 1 to the","w":0.77255640665690106,"y":0.61191860437557066,"c":1,"h":0.015988372635703185},{"y":0.62829866814796764,"h":0.016429611274832223,"t":"Writing score.","x":0.099129507600957914,"w":0.11942572275797526,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Task 1 requires candidates to look at a diagram or some data (in a graph, table or chart)","w":0.74090438842773432,"h":0.021492505488054925,"x":0.12014410818397911,"y":0.64529229910692898},{"y":0.66390041271071076,"h":0.021393576362251254,"c":1,"t":"and to present the information in their own words. They are assessed on their ability to","w":0.72770675659179684,"x":0.097627245310648245},{"x":0.099624048891370096,"c":1,"y":0.68448164833273983,"w":0.7575188191731772,"t":"organise, present and possibly compare data, and are required to describe the stages of a","h":0.017707662588538287},{"w":0.59422017415364581,"h":0.019711382068209105,"y":0.70129842344073134,"x":0.097642549713852222,"t":"process, describe an object or event, or explain how something works.","c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.022707497620690131,"y":0.71772864237233791,"t":"In Task 2, candidates are presented with a point of view, argument or problem. They are","x":0.11636646216313078,"w":0.74094731648763035},{"w":0.77669311523437501,"c":1,"y":0.73570275675847419,"h":0.023855240054845961,"t":"assessed on their ability to present a solution to the problem, present and justify an opinion,","x":0.097578804319823201},{"c":1,"h":0.024058593140827478,"t":"compare and contrast evidence and opinions, and to evaluate and challenge ideas, evidence","x":0.097575615500950424,"w":0.7804223124186197,"y":0.75290774723905474},{"x":0.097744361369947658,"w":0.12030075073242188,"h":0.014614436830617694,"y":0.77462974900274573,"t":"or arguments.","c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.11824355262210853,"t":"Candidates are also assessed on their ability to write in an appropriate style. More","w":0.69017868041992192,"y":0.79042033294180669,"h":0.02165650799438712},{"c":1,"t":"information on assessing the Writing test, including Writing assessment criteria (public","x":0.09382040963051537,"h":0.021928267715365712,"y":0.80860736330634853,"w":0.72588109334309892},{"h":0.016097875080489321,"y":0.82839665143575392,"c":1,"x":0.095864667656761826,"t":"version), is available on the IELTS website.","w":0.36654134114583331},{"x":0.86278195484031051,"w":0.013157894611358634,"y":0.95348837217183391,"h":0.014534883321060899,"c":1,"t":"5"}]}